# Curated channels that are NOT reliably present in the upstream source.
# merge_extra.py injects every entry below into dhanytv.m3u on each update so the
# weekly auto-update can never silently drop them.
#
# World Cup 2026 — verified from GitHub repos (kufa-tv, KickNow26, StreamHub, iptv-org)

# <============================================== Indonesia Channels (HLS multi-source) ===========================================================>

# --- Kanal nasional utama — HLS non-DRM, multi-source ---
# Re-verified 2026-08-26 (probe manifest + segmen dari luar negeri):
#   - mncmedia.malingtv.workers.dev = HLS global sehat utk channel MNC (RCTI/MNCTV/
#     GTV/iNews). Masterplayer.pro path lama 404 massal -> diganti.
#   - edge.medcom.id = Metro TV & Magna Channel (global, sehat).
#   - pull.daaiplus.com = DAAI TV HD resmi (global, sehat).
#   - DensTV (op-flashcon-digdayahd*.dens.tv) = geo-DNS khusus IP Indonesia
#     (host lama swiftservehd mati, diganti flashcon); dipertahankan sbg primary untuk
#     user ID karena tidak ada padanan global utk SCTV/ANTV/Indosiar dll.
#   - nl.m3u8 (119.82.250.109) = host ID, 403 dari luar negeri tapi sehat dari ID.
#   - masterplayer.pro: hanya path Kompas TV (10.m3u8) yg masih hidup; sisanya 404.
# Tiap tvg-id .id cocok dengan EPG epgshare01 -> jadwal real, bukan placeholder.

